          "description": "The ISR Shrink Rate metric displays the one-minute rate of decreases in the number of In-Sync Replicas (ISR). ISR shrinks occur when an in-sync broker goes down, as it decreases the number of in-sync replicas available for each partition replica on that broker.\n\n\nExpected value: 0",
          "timeRange": null,
          "coloringRules": null,
